      "translation": "---\ntitle: Hello\nrouteSlug: designing-for-clarity-in-chaos\ndescription: My first blog post.\ncreatedAt: 2026-01-28\nimage: /images/content/blog/designing-for-clarity-in-chaos.png\npublished: true\ntype: article\ncategory: Essay\norder: 1\ntags:\n  - Essay\n---\n\nHello, welcome to my blog.\n\nThis is the first article I've left here, and also a simple beginning."
    },
    "en:content.about.profile.md.document": {
      "fingerprint": "9ec8ea8a42b2c86891b014ca9f31f4d2d0bedac779f78503c7d0c01912ea4874",
      "translation": "---\nname: 你今天睡够八小时了吗\ncity: Chongqing, China\nmajor: Robotics Engineering\nmotto: Keep it Simple,Stupid\nportrait: /images/content/about/profile.png\n---\n\n## About Me\n\nThis is my quiet personal space—writing articles, taking notes, recording books and movies I've watched, and sharing travels. It's not social media; there's no notification or like anxiety, only text, photos, and some records. I don't like the high-intensity impact and intrusion of social apps on personal life.\n\n## Experience\n\n## Contact Me\n\n- [GitHub](https://github.com/Edmounds)\n- [Bilibili](https://space.bilibili.com/397591871)\n- [i@muelsyse.us](mailto:i@muelsyse.us)\n\n## Acknowledgments\n\n![The Movie Database](/images/tmdb-logo.svg)\n\nThis product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB."
    },
    "ja:content.blog.designing-for-clarity-in-chaos.md.document": {
      "fingerprint": "110043051f81e6aa0a55f375166b16cd77866ae5a4597705848e24e81c28bd1f",
      "translation": "---\ntitle: こんにちは\nrouteSlug: designing-for-clarity-in-chaos\ndescription: 私の最初のブログ記事です。\ncreatedAt: 2026-01-28\nimage: /images/content/blog/designing-for-clarity-in-chaos.png\npublished: true\ntype: article\ncategory: 随筆\norder: 1\ntags:\n  - 随筆\n---\n\nこんにちは、私のブログへようこそ。\n\nこれは私がここに残す最初の記事であり、シンプルな始まりでもあります。"
    },
    "ja:content.about.profile.md.document": {
      "fingerprint": "9ec8ea8a42b2c86891b014ca9f31f4d2d0bedac779f78503c7d0c01912ea4874",
      "translation": "---\nname: 你今天睡够八小时了吗\ncity: 中国重慶\nmajor: ロボット工学\nmotto: Keep it Simple,Stupid\nportrait: /images/content/about/profile.png\n---\n\n## 私について\n\nここは私の静かな個人空間です——記事を書き、ノートを取り、読んだ本や映画を記録し、旅行を共有します。ソーシャルメディアではなく、通知や「いいね」の不安もなく、文字、写真、そしていくつかの記録だけがあります。ソーシャルソフトウェアのような個人生活への高強度の影響と侵入は好きではありません。\n\n## 経歴\n\n## お問い合わせ\n\n- [GitHub](https://github.com/Edmounds)\n- [Bilibili](https://space.bilibili.com/397591871)\n- [i@muelsyse.us](mailto:i@muelsyse.us)\n\n## 謝辞\n\n![The Movie Database](/images/tmdb-logo.svg)\n\nこの製品はTMDB APIを使用していますが、TMDBによって推奨または認定されたものではありません。"
    },
